{"id":8635,"date":"2022-09-25T14:41:59","date_gmt":"2022-09-25T21:41:59","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/?post_type=lesson&#038;p=8635"},"modified":"2024-08-30T10:10:21","modified_gmt":"2024-08-30T17:10:21","slug":"0-1-introduction-to-codrone-mini","status":"publish","type":"lesson","link":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-mini\/","title":{"rendered":"0A: Introduction to CoDrone Mini"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213c5aec25\" name=\"6a2213c5aec25\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 1<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Welcome to CoDrone Mini!<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]What is CoDrone Mini? CoDrone Mini is the best beginner drone to introduce piloting and programming for young learners![\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=&#8221;https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=AZwrEs6Ppg8&#8243; align=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213c5aed37\" name=\"6a2213c5aed37\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 2<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>What's in the box?<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Here is what should be in your CoDrone Mini box:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">CoDrone Mini\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Controller<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Drone battery<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Drone battery multi-charger<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Micro USB cable<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">4 x extra propellers<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">User guide<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;8637&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213c5aedd4\" name=\"6a2213c5aedd4\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 3<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>CoDrone Mini Specifications and Features<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text][\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;8639&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;8640&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_column_text]<strong>Sensors<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Barometer (pressure sensor for estimating height)<\/li>\n<li>3-axis gyroscope and accelerometer<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Features<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Programmable buzzer on the controller<\/li>\n<li>Programmable RGB LED on the drone<\/li>\n<li>Radio Frequency (RF) controlled<\/li>\n<li>3 speed settings<\/li>\n<li>Rechargeable drone battery<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213c5aee35\" name=\"6a2213c5aee35\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 4<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Device Requirements<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]CoDrone Mini can support Blockly and Python programming. In this course, you will be programming in Blockly![\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;8641&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;][vc_column_text]Blockly is only supported on a Chrome browser on a laptop or desktop computer with USB ports.[\/vc_column_text][vc_single_image image=&#8221;8642&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; alignment=&#8221;center&#8221;]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column]<a id=\"6a2213c5aee7e\" name=\"6a2213c5aee7e\" class=\"scroll-spy-anchor\"><\/a>\n<div class=\"robolink-step \">\n\n\t\t<div class=\"robolink-step-head\"><span>Step 5<\/span><\/div>\n\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Next steps<\/h2>\n\t\n\t<p>[vc_column_text]Now that you have had a quick introduction to CoDrone Mini, see the next lesson to learn how to power on the drone, charge batteries, and how to pair drones with controllers.[\/vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<\/div>\n[\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"[vc_row][vc_column] Step 6 Welcome to CoDrone Mini! [vc_column_text]What is CoDrone Mini? CoDrone Mini is the best beginner drone to introduce piloting and programming for young learners![\/vc_column_text][vc_video link=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=AZwrEs6Ppg8\" align=\"center\"] [\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column] Step&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/lesson\/0-1-introduction-to-codrone-mini\/\">&hellip;<\/a>","protected":false},"featured_media":1688,"template":"","meta":{"_initial_content":"","_new_post":false,"_quiz_has_questions":false,"_lesson_complexity":"easy","_lesson_length":10,"_lesson_course":407,"_lesson_preview":"preview"},"lesson-category":[],"lesson-tag":[2108,4328,2174,4102,2177],"class_list":["post-8635","lesson","type-lesson","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","lesson-tag-blockly","lesson-tag-cde","lesson-tag-coding","lesson-tag-codrone-edu","lesson-tag-getting-started","module-getting-started","post","odd"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/8635","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/lesson"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/8635\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":8645,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/lessons\/8635\/revisions\/8645"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/archive.learn.robolink.com\/wp-json\